{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cbs","name":"Biblica® 圣经当代译本开放资源","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbs","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbs","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CBS","englishName":"Mandarin Chinese Open Contemporary Bible (Simplified)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"74bf453a33641322ae4ddd23e051ee64d1412722972e541371ef97308285fe7d","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":30961,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"ISA","translationId":"cmn_cbs","name":"以赛亚书","commonName":"以赛亚书","title":"以赛亚书","order":23,"numberOfChapters":66,"sha256":"632dd4147026fa600518a3f00c24b6fa8a338b17185b54576ae9104ec0242142","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/ISA/1.json","lastChapterNumber":66,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/ISA/66.json","totalNumberOfVerses":1289},"chapter":{"number":49,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["主的仆人"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":["众海岛啊，听我说！",{"text":"远方的列邦啊，要留心听！","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我还没有出生，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"耶和华就呼召我；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我还没有离开母腹，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"祂就提及我的名。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"祂使我的口像利剑，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"用祂的手荫庇我；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"祂使我成为磨亮的箭，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"把我藏在祂的箭囊中。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"祂对我说：“以色列啊，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你是我的仆人，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我要借着你彰显我的荣耀。”","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"但我说：“我虚耗精力，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"徒劳无功。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"然而，耶和华必公正地待我，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我的报酬在我的上帝那里。”","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":[{"text":"我在母腹之中，耶和华便塑造我做祂的仆人，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"叫我带领雅各归向祂，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"把以色列人召集到祂那里。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我在耶和华眼中是尊贵的，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我的上帝是我的力量。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"祂对我说：“我不单单只是让你做我的仆人，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"去复兴雅各的众支派，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"使以色列得保全的人重归故土。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我还要使你成为外族人的光，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"好把我的救恩带到地极。”","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"以色列的救赎主和圣者耶和华对受藐视、","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"被本国人憎恨、","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"遭官长奴役的那位说：","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"“因着信实的耶和华——拣选你的以色列的圣者，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"君王一见你必肃然起立，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"首领一见你必俯伏下拜。”","poem":1}]},{"type":"heading","content":["以色列的复兴"]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":[{"text":"耶和华说：","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"“在悦纳的时候，我应允了你；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"在拯救的日子，我帮助了你。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我要保护你，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"使你做我跟民众立约的中保，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"复兴这片土地，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"分配荒凉的产业。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你要对被囚禁的人说，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"‘出来吧！’","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"要对黑暗中的人说，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"‘你们自由了。’","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他们在路上必有吃的，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"光秃的山岭上必有食物。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他们不再饥渴，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"也不再被热风和烈日灼伤，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因为怜悯他们的那位必引导他们，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"领他们到泉水边。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我要使我的群山变为通途，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"修筑我的大路。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"看啊，他们必从远方来。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"有的来自北方，有的来自西方，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"还有的来自希尼","poem":1},{"noteId":21},{"text":"。”","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":13,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"诸天啊，要欢呼！","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"大地啊，要快乐！","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"群山啊，要歌唱！","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因为耶和华安慰祂的子民，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"怜悯祂受苦的百姓。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":14,"content":[{"text":"但锡安说：“耶和华撇弃了我，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"主把我忘了。”","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":15,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"耶和华说：“母亲岂能忘记自己吃奶的婴儿，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"不怜悯自己亲生的孩子？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"就算有母亲忘记，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我也不会忘记你。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":16,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"看啊，我已经把你铭刻在我的手掌上，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你的墙垣时刻在我的看顾之下。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":17,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你的儿女必很快回来，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"毁灭和破坏你的必离你而去。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":18,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"举目四下看看吧，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你的儿女正聚集到你这里。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我凭我的永恒起誓，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你必把他们作为饰物戴在身上，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"如新娘一样用他们妆扮自己。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"这是耶和华说的。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":19,"content":[{"text":"“你那荒废、凄凉、","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"遭到毁坏之地现在必容不下你的居民，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"那些吞灭你的人必远远地离开你。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":20,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你流亡期间所生的子女必在你耳边说，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"‘这地方太小了，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"再给我们一些地方住吧。’","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":21,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你会在心里问，‘我丧失了儿女、","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"不再生育，流亡在外，漂流不定，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"谁给我生了这些儿女？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"谁把他们养大？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我孤身留下，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他们是从哪里来的？’”","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":22,"content":[{"text":"主耶和华说：","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"“看啊，我必向列国招手，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"向万民竖立我的旗帜，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他们必抱着你的儿子、","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"背着你的女儿回来。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":23,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"列王必做你的养父，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"王后必做你的乳母。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他们必向你俯伏下拜，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"舔你脚上的尘土。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"那时你便知道我是耶和华，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"仰望我的必不致羞愧。”","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":24,"content":[{"text":"勇士抢去的能夺回来吗？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"暴君掳走的能救回来吗？","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":25,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"但耶和华说：","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"“勇士掳去的必被夺回，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"暴君抢去的必被救出。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我必与你的对头作对，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"拯救你的儿女。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":26,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我要使那些欺压你的人吞吃自己的肉，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"喝自己的血喝得酩酊大醉，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"好像喝酒一样。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"那时候，世人都必知道我耶和华是你的救主，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"是你的救赎主，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"是雅各的大能者。”","poem":1}]}],"footnotes":[{"noteId":21,"caller":"+","text":"“希尼”可能指遥远的东方或南方某地。","reference":{"chapter":49,"verse":12}}]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/ISA/49.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/ISA/50.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/ISA/48.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":26}